https://github.com/databendlabs/databend/issues/20591   confirmed

DROP DATABASE IF EXISTS repro_databend912_db7_min;
CREATE DATABASE repro_databend912_db7_min;
USE repro_databend912_db7_min;

CREATE TABLE source (
    vp_rowid BIGINT NOT NULL,
    c0boolean BOOLEAN,
    c1int BIGINT
) ENGINE=FUSE;

INSERT INTO source VALUES
(1, false, -1),
(2, false, -2),
(3, false, -3),
(4, true,  -4),
(5, true,  -5),
(6, true,  -6),
(7, true,  -7),
(8, true,  -8),
(9, true,  -9);

CREATE TABLE part_l (
    vp_rowid BIGINT NOT NULL,
    c1int BIGINT
) ENGINE=MEMORY;

CREATE TABLE part_r (
    vp_rowid BIGINT NOT NULL,
    c0boolean BOOLEAN
) ENGINE=FUSE;

INSERT INTO part_l
SELECT vp_rowid, c1int FROM source;

INSERT INTO part_r
SELECT vp_rowid, c0boolean FROM source;

SELECT
    SUM(c1int),
    vp_rowid,
    c1int
FROM source
WHERE c0boolean
GROUP BY vp_rowid, c1int
ORDER BY vp_rowid, c1int
LIMIT 3;

SELECT
    SUM(s.c1int),
    s.vp_rowid,
    s.c1int
FROM (
    SELECT
        l.vp_rowid,
        r.c0boolean,
        l.c1int
    FROM part_l l
    JOIN LATERAL (
        SELECT *
        FROM part_r rr
        WHERE rr.vp_rowid = l.vp_rowid
    ) r ON TRUE
) s
WHERE s.c0boolean
GROUP BY s.vp_rowid, s.c1int
ORDER BY s.vp_rowid, s.c1int
LIMIT 3;

单表结果为 3 行：
-4  4  -4
-5  5  -5
-6  6  -6
多表结果为空，COUNT(*) 验证：
single_count = 3
split_count  = 0

单表查询计划：
Limit
└── Sort(Single)
    └── AggregateFinal
        └── AggregatePartial
            └── TableScan source
                output columns: [vp_rowid, c1int]
                filters: [is_true(source.c0boolean)]
                read rows: 9
                partitions total: 1
                partitions scanned: 1
关键点：单表路径直接扫描 source，过滤 c0boolean 后进入聚合，实际返回 3 行。
LATERAL split 查询计划：
Limit
└── Sort(Single)
    └── EvalScalar
        └── AggregateFinal
            └── AggregatePartial
                └── HashJoin
                    join type: INNER
                    build keys: [vp_rowid]
                    probe keys: [vp_rowid]

                    ├── TableScan(Build) part_r
                    │   output columns: [vp_rowid]
                    │   filters: [is_true(part_r.c0boolean)]
                    │   read rows: 9
                    │   partitions total: 1
                    │   partitions scanned: 1
                    │
                    └── AggregateFinal(Probe)
                        └── AggregatePartial
                            └── TableScan part_l
                                output columns: [vp_rowid, c1int]
                                read rows: 9
                                partitions total: 0
                                partitions scanned: 0
                                filters: []
                                apply join filters: [#0]
这里最可疑的差异是：
part_l: partitions total: 0, partitions scanned: 0
但 part_l 是 MEMORY 表且实际有 9 行。计划估算仍显示预计有 3 行输出，但实际 split 查询返回 0 行。
实测结果：
single_count = 3
split_count  = 0

可能原因：外层聚合被下推到 part_l 的 TableScan，而 part_l 是 MEMORY 表，分区元数据为空，导致 partitions total: 0, partitions scanned: 0，probe 侧实际输入为空。